[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 7.523,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "研报"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近半导体圈子里都在讨论一个叫“Tau定律”的东西，你怎么看？",
    "start": 7.883,
    "end": 12.992,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "半导体",
      "Tau定律"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，这是华为在ISCAS会议上提出的一个全新路线图，很多人把它称作“又一个DeepSeek时刻”。",
    "start": 13.352,
    "end": 21.572,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "华为",
      "ISCAS",
      "路线图"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "为什么大家会用DeepSeek来类比？这听起来好像不是一个简单的技术升级。",
    "start": 21.932,
    "end": 28.294,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "DeepSeek",
      "类比",
      "技术升级"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "核心在于，DeepSeek证明了中国AI算法可以绕过算力瓶颈，而Tau定律则试图证明，",
    "start": 28.654,
    "end": 37.106,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "DeepSeek",
      "AI算法",
      "算力瓶颈"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "中国半导体可以在没有EUV光刻机的情况下，持续提升芯片性能。",
    "start": 37.466,
    "end": 43.596,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "中国半导体",
      "EUV光刻机",
      "芯片性能"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以这份报告真正要回答的问题是，中国半导体到底能不能绕过EUV的限制，找到一条自己的路？",
    "start": 43.956,
    "end": 52.362,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "中国半导体",
      "EUV",
      "限制"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错。报告认为，Tau定律提供了一个可预测的、可扩展的路线图，它不再追求把晶体管做得更小，",
    "start": 52.722,
    "end": 62.056,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau定律",
      "路线图",
      "晶体管"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "而是追求把信号延迟降得更低。",
    "start": 62.416,
    "end": 65.481,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "信号延迟"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "信号延迟？这个怎么理解？",
    "start": 65.841,
    "end": 68.442,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "信号延迟"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "简单说，就是芯片里从一个晶体管到另一个晶体管，信号传输的时间。Tau定律的核心，",
    "start": 68.802,
    "end": 76.929,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "晶体管",
      "信号传输",
      "Tau定律"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "就是在整个芯片堆叠的各个环节，系统性地降低这个时间常数。",
    "start": 77.289,
    "end": 82.722,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "芯片堆叠",
      "时间常数"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "听起来是个很底层的创新。那具体到技术实现上，有什么关键亮点吗？",
    "start": 83.082,
    "end": 90.048,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "技术实现"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里提到了一个叫“LogicFolding”的技术。乍一看，它和台积电的SoIC有点像，",
    "start": 90.408,
    "end": 97.328,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "LogicFolding",
      "台积电",
      "SoIC"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "都是把两个芯片堆叠在一起。",
    "start": 97.688,
    "end": 100.01,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "芯片堆叠"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那区别在哪？",
    "start": 100.37,
    "end": 101.623,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "区别"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "区别在于堆叠的颗粒度。台积电的SoIC是芯片级别的堆叠，比如把SRAM堆在逻辑芯片上。",
    "start": 101.983,
    "end": 109.832,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "堆叠",
      "颗粒度",
      "台积电"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "但华为的LogicFolding做到了亚微米级的键合间距，可以实现“单元对单元”的堆叠。",
    "start": 110.192,
    "end": 116.693,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "华为",
      "LogicFolding",
      "亚微米级"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "单元对单元？这意味着什么？",
    "start": 117.053,
    "end": 119.793,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "单元对单元"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "意味着他们能把逻辑电路里的计算部分和存储部分，直接上下堆叠起来。",
    "start": 120.153,
    "end": 126.609,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "逻辑电路",
      "计算",
      "存储"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这样信号从一个单元走到另一个单元的距离就大大缩短了，延迟自然就降下来了。",
    "start": 126.969,
    "end": 134.445,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "信号",
      "距离",
      "延迟"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以不仅提升了密度，还提升了频率？",
    "start": 134.805,
    "end": 137.917,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "密度",
      "频率"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，报告里给出的数据是，在2026年，",
    "start": 138.277,
    "end": 142.038,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "2026年"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "他们目标是把晶体管密度从155 MTr/mm2提升到238 MTr/mm2，",
    "start": 142.398,
    "end": 151.408,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "晶体管密度",
      "155 MTr/mm2",
      "238 MTr/mm2"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "同时核心频率也能提升13%以上。",
    "start": 151.768,
    "end": 155.065,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "核心频率",
      "13%"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这听起来确实很厉害。但这是不是意味着中国半导体就能追上全球领先水平了？",
    "start": 155.425,
    "end": 163.041,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "中国半导体",
      "全球领先"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告并没有这么乐观。它明确指出了几个约束条件。第一，Tau定律高度依赖先进的3D封装技术，",
    "start": 163.401,
    "end": 172.968,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "约束条件",
      "3D封装"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "而台积电在这方面仍然有巨大的技术和生态优势。",
    "start": 173.328,
    "end": 178.111,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "台积电",
      "技术",
      "生态优势"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以封装技术成了新的瓶颈？",
    "start": 178.471,
    "end": 181.583,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "封装技术",
      "瓶颈"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "是的。第二，堆叠芯片会带来巨大的功耗密度问题，散热是个大麻烦。第三，良率和成本也是商业化必须解决的难题。",
    "start": 181.943,
    "end": 192.949,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "功耗密度",
      "散热",
      "良率"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那这份报告里，有没有提到哪些公司可能会受益于这个路线图？",
    "start": 193.309,
    "end": 198.882,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "公司",
      "受益",
      "路线图"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告重点提到了几家。比如中芯国际，因为它是华为实现这个路线图的关键制造伙伴。还有北方华创，",
    "start": 199.242,
    "end": 208.669,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "中芯国际",
      "华为",
      "制造伙伴"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "因为它能提供先进逻辑制造所需的设备。",
    "start": 209.029,
    "end": 212.326,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "先进逻辑制造",
      "设备"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那还有一家叫拓荆科技的公司，报告里也提到了。",
    "start": 212.686,
    "end": 217.144,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "拓荆科技"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "对，报告认为拓荆科技在键合设备上可能有潜力，所以市场会把它看作核心受益方之一。",
    "start": 217.504,
    "end": 224.517,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "拓荆科技",
      "键合设备",
      "核心受益方"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "听你这么说，这份报告其实不只是讲技术，更像是在讲一个完整的产业故事？",
    "start": 224.877,
    "end": 231.1,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "产业故事"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错。DeepSeek让中国AI产业有了信心去研究AI，",
    "start": 231.46,
    "end": 235.732,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "DeepSeek",
      "中国AI",
      "信心"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "而Tau定律则让中国半导体产业有了信心去研究整个本土半导体产业链。",
    "start": 236.092,
    "end": 242.965,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "Tau定律",
      "中国半导体",
      "信心"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那报告里有没有哪些问题是没有完全展开的？比如这个路线图具体什么时候能真正落地？",
    "start": 243.325,
    "end": 251.127,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "路线图",
      "落地"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告确实没有详细展开商业化时间表。比如LogicFolding的良率到底能不能达到量产标准，",
    "start": 251.487,
    "end": 259.754,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "商业化时间表",
      "LogicFolding",
      "良率"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "以及在高性能计算场景下，功耗墙到底怎么突破，这些在完整报告里应该有更深入的讨论。",
    "start": 260.114,
    "end": 267.915,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "高性能计算",
      "功耗墙"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那看来要真正理解这个路线图的潜力，还是得去读完整版报告。",
    "start": 268.275,
    "end": 273.198,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "路线图",
      "潜力",
      "完整版报告"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "是的。如果你也想加入我们的投研社群，获取这份报告的完整解读，欢迎在节目详情页找到我们的联系方式。",
    "start": 273.558,
    "end": 282.707,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "投研社群",
      "完整解读"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "好，感谢你今天的分享，我们下期再聊。",
    "start": 283.067,
    "end": 286.178,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "分享"
    ]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "谢谢，下期见。",
    "start": 286.538,
    "end": 288.024,
    "voice_id": "bdt3B5N3GXM2nOc0SUW7",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "谢谢",
      "下期见"
    ]
  }
]